        "anon_desc" to "While translating at most once every 10 minutes, and after opening the app at most once every 6 hours, a random device number, the app version, device and TV type, translation language, setup step and the names of changed options (not their values) are sent – only to count users and see what is used. No name, account, address or game text.",
